<title>USA: TAMPA PORT AUTHORITY, FLA., $9 MLN BONDS REPRICED.</title>
<headline>TAMPA PORT AUTHORITY, FLA., $9 MLN BONDS REPRICED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it repriced Hillsborough County Port District, Fla.'s $9.4 million Tampa Port Authority bonds.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>HILLSBOROUGH COUNTY PORT DISTRICT</p>
<p>TAMPA PORT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $9,380,000*</p>
<p>REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(TAMPA BAY INTERNATIONAL TERMINALS, INC. PROJECT)</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD. The account is closed.</p>
